"title":"Click here","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/eastidahonews-com-code-of-ethics/#onlinecommenting","line":43}],"metadata":{"title":"Groundbreaking date announced for Latter-day Saint Temple in Idaho","source":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/07/groundbreaking-date-announced-for-latter-day-saint-temple-in-idaho/","author":["[[Nate Eaton]]","[[Envy]]","[[Stephen]]","[[Ferron Sonderegger]]","[[SupportICE]]","[[vic]]","[[Sam Eric]]","[[CycloneCteve]]","[[Brin Gem Young]]","[[Snuzel Butt]]"],"published":"2026-07-06","created":"2026-07-07","description":"COEUR D’ALENE — The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints has announced the date for the groundbreaking ceremony of the new Coeur d’Alene Idaho Temple. The ceremony will be held Saturday, Aug. 29. Elder Hutch U. Fale of the United States West Area Presidency will preside over the event, according to a news release […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},